<title>MEXICO: Banca Serfin places $230 mln paper program.</title>
<headline>Banca Serfin places $230 mln paper program.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero, Banca Serfin SA, said that it had successfully placed a commercial paper program for $230 million.</p>
<p>The initial program was set for $150 million, but due to good demand the issue size was increased, the bank said.</p>
<p>The paper received a rating of A-1+ from Standard &amp; Poors and P-1 from Moody's Investor Services, the bank added.</p>
</text>
